Subject: [PATCH] Reorganize device tree source file for the Cargt i.MX8MP
 00377 OSM-L SOM on the 00365 carrier board and add support for 10" LVDS
 display (GLT1011280800IS1).

Co-authored-by: Copilot <copilot@github.com>
